# Interview answer key — never committed (public repo).
# `hiring/*`, not `hiring/` — git cannot re-include a file inside an
# excluded *directory*, so the negation below is silently dead against
# `hiring/`: the README it names would be ignored along with everything else.
hiring/*
!hiring/README.md
